plush.item.name=Miner's Plush
plush.item.description=A goblin plush that wriggles on its own.
plush.speaker.name=Grizzle
plush.speaker.epithet=Miner's plush
plush.speaker.epithet-fed=Well-fed plush
plush.rustle.title=???
plush.rustle.text=Ŕŕŗk... ğrůůmm... şşk ŧħŕŏk, ŵŵŕŕŕ... ĝŕĭżż?
plush.rustle.what=What is that?
plush.intro.page1=Stop shaking me! Yes, me, the plush in your pocket. Name's Grizzle.
plush.intro.page2=I was a miner's plush, deep under the goblin hills. Copper, iron, gold: I ate it all, and in return I knew every way back to daylight.
plush.intro.page3=Now I am starving and stitched up like a rag. Feed me, and I will show you the way up whenever you are lost below.
plush.intro.want=What do you want?
plush.intro.hush=Hush.
plush.hungry.text=Ten copper, ten iron, ten gold. Raw ore, nothing smelted. My stomach rumbles louder than a cave in.
plush.hungry.feed=Here, eat.
plush.hungry.give-up=I will not feed you.
plush.hungry.later=Later.
plush.sniff.text=Sniff... sniff... Is that gold? Do not wave it under my nose like that!
plush.sniff.answer=Patience.
plush.fed.text=Ahh, I feel like a proper plush again. Lost in the dark? Just ask.
plush.fed.up=Take me up.
plush.refused.text=Hmph. I only deal with licensed miners, and nobody signed your licence. Come back when the server says otherwise.
plush.refused.answer=Fine.
plush.fed.sad=You look sad.
plush.fed.home=Here we are, home.
plush.fed.story=Tell me your story.
plush.fed.story-again=Tell it again.
plush.fed.bye=Goodbye.
plush.story.page1=A goblin foreman sewed me from a sack of ore and the coat of his best digger.
plush.story.page2=He hung me on his belt, and every time the tunnel caved in I sniffed the way out. The crew never lost a soul.
plush.story.page3=Then the breach swallowed the whole camp, and I was left behind in the dust. Until you came along.
plush.story.answer=I see.
plush.mumble.text=Zzz... ğŏŏld... mŏŏŕe ğŏld... zzz...
plush.mumble.wake=Wake up.
quest.chapter.strange-plush=The strange plush
quest.veins.title=First veins
quest.veins.description=Every miner remembers their first glint of metal in the rock.
quest.veins.short=Mine copper, iron and gold ore
quest.veins-copper.title=A copper vein
quest.veins-copper.description=Mine a block of copper ore.
quest.veins-iron.title=An iron vein
quest.veins-iron.description=Mine a block of iron ore.
quest.veins-gold.title=A gold vein
quest.veins-gold.description=Mine a block of gold ore.
quest.voice.title=A voice in the pocket
quest.voice.description=Something in your pocket is rustling. Something that was not there before.
quest.voice.short=Listen to what is moving in your pocket
quest.appetite.title=Miner's appetite
quest.appetite.description=Grizzle has not eaten since the breach swallowed its camp, and it only eats ore.
quest.appetite.short=Feed ten copper, ten iron and ten gold ore to Grizzle
quest.appetite-copper.title=Ten copper ore
quest.appetite-copper.description=Carry ten copper ore.
quest.appetite-iron.title=Ten iron ore
quest.appetite-iron.description=Carry ten iron ore.
quest.appetite-gold.title=Ten gold ore
quest.appetite-gold.description=Carry ten gold ore.
quest.appetite-feed.title=Feed Grizzle
quest.appetite-feed.description=Hand the ore over to the plush.
quest.homesick.title=Homesick
quest.homesick.description=Well fed, Grizzle still sighs at night. It misses the goblin hills it came from.
quest.homesick.short=Bring Grizzle through a Goblin Breach
quest.home.title=Home at last
quest.home.description=Grizzle is home, among the goblins. Let it tell you so.
quest.home.short=Tell Grizzle it is home, inside the breach
kweebec.speaker.name=Kweebec
kweebec.name.bramble=Bramble
kweebec.name.fern=Fern
kweebec.name.moss=Moss
kweebec.name.sorrel=Sorrel
kweebec.farmer.epithet=Farmer
kweebec.farmer.text=The soil is generous this season. Mind the seedlings on your way through.
kweebec.farmer.bye=I will.
kweebec.mage.epithet=Mage
kweebec.mage.text=The roots hum tonight. Something old stirs beneath the forest.
kweebec.mage.bye=I will keep my ears open.
kweebec.child.epithet=Curious child
kweebec.child.text=Do you think beetles dream? I asked one, it did not answer.
kweebec.child.bye=Maybe they do.
quest.kweebectalk.title=A word with the farmer
quest.kweebectalk.description=The Kweebec village has a farmer who knows every seedling by name. Go and say hello.
quest.kweebectalk.short=Talk to the village farmer
quest.kweebecmage.title=The only mage
quest.kweebecmage.description=There is only one Kweebec mage in all the lands, and the roots speak through them. Seek them out before it is too late.
quest.kweebecmage.short=Talk to the Kweebec mage
quest.kweebecfarewell.title=Mind the seedlings
quest.kweebecfarewell.description=The farmer worries about the seedlings. Promise to be careful on your way through.
quest.kweebecfarewell.short=Promise the farmer to mind the seedlings
quest.kweebecfibres.title=Fibres for the farmer
quest.kweebecfibres.description=The farmer needs plant fibre and sticks to tie up the seedlings. Bring them, all at once or a bit at a time.
quest.kweebecfibres.short=Bring 10 fibres and 5 sticks to the farmer
quest.seedlingfeatherslight.title=Soft as a cloud
quest.seedlingfeatherslight.description=The little seedling saw pale feathers on his brothers and sisters and has thought of nothing else since. Bring him a few from the hens and pigeons outside.
quest.seedlingfeatherslight.short=Bring light feathers to the seedling
quest.seedlingfeathersdark.title=Feathers of the night
quest.seedlingfeathersdark.description=Now he dreams of feathers as dark as the sky between the stars. Crows and sparrows wear them.
quest.seedlingfeathersdark.short=Bring dark feathers to the seedling
quest.seedlingfeathersred.title=A splash of red
quest.seedlingfeathersred.description=Red feathers, like a sunset he has never seen. Ducks and finches might part with a few.
quest.seedlingfeathersred.short=Bring red feathers to the seedling
quest.seedlingshell.title=The song of the sea
quest.seedlingshell.description=Someone told him the sea sings inside its shells. He wants to hear it for himself. Look along the shallow shores.
quest.seedlingshell.short=Bring a seashell to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardsgreen.title=What the elders hold
quest.seedlingshardsgreen.description=He watched the elders turn shining shards in their hands and fell in love with the light. Start with green ones.
quest.seedlingshardsgreen.short=Bring green crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardscyan.title=The colour of deep water
quest.seedlingshardscyan.description=Cyan shards glow like water under the moon. He wants to hold one up to the light.
quest.seedlingshardscyan.short=Bring cyan crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardspink.title=Pink like blossoms
quest.seedlingshardspink.description=Pink shards hide in geodes and strange crystal trees. He is sure they smell of flowers.
quest.seedlingshardspink.short=Bring pink crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardswhite.title=White as the moon
quest.seedlingshardswhite.description=White shards, pale as the moon. Geodes and deep caves keep them.
quest.seedlingshardswhite.short=Bring white crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingfeatherblue.title=The rarest blue
quest.seedlingfeatherblue.description=A blue feather, just one. Bluebirds are shy and few, so it will take patience.
quest.seedlingfeatherblue.short=Bring a blue feather to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardsblue.title=A shard of frost
quest.seedlingshardsblue.description=Blue shards grow where the world freezes over. He shivers just thinking about it.
quest.seedlingshardsblue.short=Bring blue crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingfeathersblue.title=A whole blue wing
quest.seedlingfeathersblue.description=One blue feather was not enough: he wants enough to make a wing. Bluebirds, or the great beasts of the far jungles.
quest.seedlingfeathersblue.short=Bring blue feathers to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardspurple.title=Purple from far away
quest.seedlingshardspurple.description=Purple shards only show in the caves of the farthest lands. He calls them dragon eyes.
quest.seedlingshardspurple.short=Bring purple crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardsyellow.title=A piece of lightning
quest.seedlingshardsyellow.description=Yellow shards crackle like a storm caught in stone. They come from the scorched far lands.
quest.seedlingshardsyellow.short=Bring yellow crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingshardsred.title=Fire in the hand
quest.seedlingshardsred.description=The last colour he is missing: red shards, warm as embers, from the lands of ash and lava.
quest.seedlingshardsred.short=Bring red crystal shards to the seedling
quest.seedlingrainbow.title=Every colour
quest.seedlingrainbow.description=Every feather, every shard: his collection is complete. Go and see what the seedling has been hiding for you.
quest.seedlingrainbow.short=Visit the seedling
temple.seedling.epithet=Curious seedling
temple.seedling.intro.page1=Hello! Hello! Are you from outside? Is it true the sky out there has no ceiling?
temple.seedling.intro.page2=My big sister has a feather, a real one, soft soft soft. I touched it once. Could you find me some? I have treasures too, you know. Little ones.
temple.seedling.intro.yes=I will look for feathers.
temple.seedling.bye=See you soon.
temple.seedling.feathers.text=I put them under my pillow, all in a row. Do birds outside really fly higher than the temple?
temple.seedling.shards.text=The elders let the shards catch the light and the whole room turns into colours. I want every colour. Every single one!
temple.seedling.gift.text=You found it? Show me, show me! Here, I kept something for you. Do not tell the elders where it came from.
temple.seedling.gift.give=Here it is.
temple.seedling.gift.later=Not yet.
temple.seedling.rainbow.page1=Look! Every feather and every shard, all lined up like a rainbow. Nobody in the temple has a rainbow. Only me!
temple.seedling.rainbow.page2=This is my best treasure. I found it near the goblin machines. It hums. I think it opens a door somewhere deep. You should have it, you are the best explorer.
temple.seedling.rainbow.thanks=Thank you, little one.
temple.seedling.thanks.text=When I am big, I will go outside and see all the colours for real. You will come with me, right?
